# What the published archive leaves out.
#
# `.pubignore` replaces `.gitignore` for publishing: a path ignored by git is not
# excluded here unless it is named again, so this file repeats the git
# exclusions. `bin/` matters most: a Dart SDK unpacked there is hundreds of
# megabytes.
#
# Published: lib/, README.md, CHANGELOG.md (pub.dev asks for one), LICENSE,
# pubspec.yaml.

# Publish-only: internal to this repository.
# The live suite, which calls a real instance and writes records.
test/
# How `dart test` runs it: concurrency, platform, timeout and the tags. It
# describes nothing a consumer of the package can run.
dart_test.yaml
DEVELOPMENT.md
CLAUDE.md
ENDPOINTS.md
docs/
analysis_options.yaml
.env.example

# Also excluded from git.
bin/
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
doc/api/
pubspec.lock
scratchpad/
.env
.env.*
captures/
sweep_result.json
token.json
*_token.json
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
